  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: S. Marco d\u2019Alunzio</p>\r\n<p>A small, extramural Hellenistic temple that is traditionally identified as being sacred to Hercules lies outside the modern village. Of isodomic construction, it measures ca. 20 by 8 meters.</p>",
